# Inventory only: obtain real values externally; no executable fallback credentials.
# POSTGRES_USER
# POSTGRES_DB
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD
# STAGING_TLS_CERT (absolute path to externally issued PEM certificate chain)
# STAGING_TLS_KEY (absolute path to protected PEM private key)
# STAGING_TLS_NAME (DNS name covered by the certificate, used by verification)
# ENVIRONMENT must be staging when later deploying the application.
